# Client folders — files under NDA / personal data of third parties.
# In modes WITH internet (claude-local --web, «Лаборатория») these folders are closed: not opened as a
# work folder, unreadable even by absolute path, closed in the kernel sandbox even inside the work folder.
# Work with them only in «Локальный Claude» (no internet).
#
# One absolute path per line (~ allowed). Matching ignores case and Unicode normalization (NFC/NFD).
# Also list here private notes/vaults you never want an online session to read.
# The installing agent fills this list WITH the user (01_ПЛАН-УСТАНОВКИ.md, phase 1).
#
# ~/Clients
# ~/Projects/acme-corp
